    "GDCnvQstEditor — Grim Dawn .cnv / .qst editor\n\nView, edit, create, import/export and batch-process; the format is based on reverse-engineering the Game.dll loader and 447 verified samples.\n\nThree checks run before saving (records tile the file / localization offset / round-trip bytes). A structurally valid file is not necessarily semantically correct;\nafter changing yellow unknown-semantics fields, verify in game or the official editor.": "GDCnvQstEditor —— Grim Dawn .cnv / .qst 编辑器\n\n查看、编辑、新建、导入导出与批量处理；格式依据 Game.dll 加载器逆向与 447 个样本验证。\n\n保存前自动执行三检查（记录铺满 / 本地化偏移 / round-trip 字节一致），结构合法不等于语义正确，\n标黄的未知语义字段改完请在游戏或官方编辑器中验证。",
